meta {
  name: 08 Verify Reported OS
  type: http
  seq: 08
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/reported-os-assignments?device_id={{demoDeviceId}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  device_id: {{demoDeviceId}}
}

docs {
  `GET /reported-os-assignments` — after rebooting, the device reports the
  OS version it actually booted into (via `PUT /device/os`).

  **Expect:** an entry with `os_version_id` = `{{osVersionId}}`. Re-send
  until it appears — download + reboot takes a few minutes depending on
  image size. `02 Device Summaries` shows the same result fleet-wide.
}
